  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Times News Network\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                                Times News Network\n                                                                \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Updated On Aug 31, 2026 at 02:41 PM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Visakhapatnam: Hyderabad-based <a href=\"/tag/aig+hospitals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AIG Hospitals</a> will invest <a href=\"/tag/rs+2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Rs 2</a>,000 crore in phases over the next five years to set up a major healthcare facility at Yendada in Visakhapatnam. State education and IT minister Nara Lokesh will lay the foundation stone for the project on Aug 3<a href=\"/tag/1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1</a>. The hospital will be developed on nine acres and will eventually have 1,000 beds.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>It is designed to handle around 5,000 outpatient consultations a day. The project is expected to bring advanced and specialised healthcare services closer to patients in Andhra Pradesh and reduce the need to travel to Hyderabad for treatment.AIG Hospitals, part of the <a href=\"/tag/asian+institute+of+gastroenterology\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Asian Institute of Gastroenterology</a>, will also establish a <a href=\"/tag/nursing+college\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">nursing college</a> on 2.5 acres. The campus will integrate healthcare, medical education, training and research, besides providing facilities for patients and their attendants.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M -->\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>The first phase will comprise Towers A and B with 650 beds and is scheduled for completion by Oct 2028. Tower C, with another 350 beds, will be taken up in the second phase and completed within two years.The facility will offer more than 50 medical specialities through eight <a href=\"/tag/centres+of+excellence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Centres of Excellence</a>. A dedicated mother-and-child care unit will also be established.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>The campus will have a nursing college and hostel, a paramedical training centre and a 500-seat auditorium for continuing medical education programmes. A research laboratory and an <a href=\"/tag/artificial+intelligence+%28ai%29+centre\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">artificial intelligence (AI) centre</a> will also be part of the clinical system.</p><p>On Monday afternoon, Lokesh will unveil a statue of former chief minister Konijeti Rosaiah in Ward 28 of Visakhapatnam. He will also inaugurate the new college building of Prema Group of Institutions and the new buildings of Age Care Foundation near the IIMV campus at Gambheeram in Anandapuram mandal.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Times News Network</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Times News Network</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Aug 31, 2026 at 02:41 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Aug 31, 2026 at 06:51 AM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the ETHealthworld App</a> and get the Realtime updates and Save your favourite articles.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                                            <!-- <div class=\"app-store-container desktop-view\">\n                       